    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my client has been stuck on their squat for like 3 weeks now. they can't seem to add any weight to the bar even though they're eating enough. how do deload weeks and changing up the volume actually help break a plateau like this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
