    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. when you talk about the \"novel stimulus\" part, are you saying the body just gets bored with the same heavy sets? or is it more of a mechanical thing with how the muscle fibers are being used? i just want to explain the actual science behind it to them so it doesn't just sound like i'm telling them to take a week off for no reason.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
